	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<h2>Who Am I?</h2>
	<p>
		Software engineer who loves web development, video games, and design. I
		have a passion for creating and building things that allow me to express
		myself creatively through the logical medium of code. I currently work
		at Trader Joe's while pursuing my M.S. in Software Engineering and am
		taking on small freelance opportunities.
	</p>
	<h2>Experience</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>
			<p>
				<strong>Software Engineering Intern</strong> at <em>Veradigm</em
				> (Summer 2022)
			</p>
			<p>
				Designed and implemented unit tests for UI components, and
				participated in an interdisciplinary team to design potential AI
				features for the company's suite of products.
			</p>
		</li>
		<li>
			<p>
				<strong>Tax Verification Associate</strong> at <em
					>Thomson Reuters</em
				> (Contract, Jan 2025-May 2025)
