		<li>Familiarity with SQL and NoSQL databases</li>
		<li>Strong problem-solving and debugging skills</li>
		<li>Excellent communication and teamwork abilities</li>
	</ul>
	<h2>Education</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>
			<p>
				<strong>M.S. in Computer Science</strong> at <em
					>University of St. Thomas</em
				> (Expected Graduation: May 2026)
			</p>
			<p>
				Coursework includes software engineering, web development,
				database systems, and artificial intelligence.
			</p>
		</li>
		<li>
			<p>
				<strong>B.A. in Computer Science, B.S. in Data Science</strong> at
